":"A burst pipe at 2am generates a $1,800 invoice. The homeowner pays by card. You absorb a 2.5% processing fee, which is $45 on that one job. Over a month of emergency calls, you're paying hundreds in fees on your highest-margin work. It adds up faster than most plumbers track."}]]}]]}]}],["$","div","No-shows on service calls cost you drive time and wages",{"className":"bg-navy-soft rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/5","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-red-400","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","strokeWidth":2,"d":"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-cream mb-3","children":"No-shows on service calls cost you drive time and wages"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-cream/60 leading-relaxed","children":"Your plumber drove 45 minutes each way to a drain cleaning that was booked for 9am. The customer is not answering. You leave, invoice a drive fee if you have one, and move on. But you lost two hours of productive time that you cannot get back. Deposits and card-on-file policies fix this."}]]}]]}]}],["$","div","Estimates on re-pipes and bathroom renos get declined without financing",{"className":"bg-navy-soft rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/5","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-red-400","fill":"none","